---
layout: layout.njk
page_key: events
pagination:
  data: languageList
  size: 1
  alias: lang
permalink: "{{ pages.events[lang] }}"
---
{#
  events.njk: eigenständige Seite für "Veranstaltungen" (analog zu
  imprint.njk / privacy.njk) - eigene URL pro Sprache über pages.events,
  eigene Texte über t.events.*, Zurück-Leiste + Logo kommen automatisch
  aus nav.njk (dort greift der "sonst"-Zweig für jeden page_key ausser
  "home").

  Struktur:
  1. .events-page-row - unbeschränkte Reihe auf Sektionsebene: zwei
     echte Spalten.
       a) .events-main (2/3): Eyebrow, Headline, horizontales
          Zukunfts-Karussell - zeigt ALLE zukünftigen Events inkl. heute
       b) .past-events (1/3): "Erinnerungen" für vergangene Events.
          ZWEI Darstellungen, per CSS ein-/ausgeblendet:
            - .past-flip-desktop: ab 900px, vertikaler Flip-Kalender-
              Effekt (unverändert wie bisher)
            - .past-mobile-carousel: unter 900px, ein STRUKTURELLER
              KLON des Zukunfts-Karussells (identische CSS-Klassen wie
              .events-main, identischer JS-Regler
              createCarouselController) - dadurch exakt dasselbe
              Verhalten (inkl. Fingerwischen, Pfeile, Punkte) wie beim
              Zukunfts-Karussell, nur mit Jahr statt Datum/Uhrzeit und
              ohne Location/Link. Vermeidet die Layout-Bugs, die beim
              Versuch entstanden, den Flip-Effekt selbst mobil-tauglich
              zu machen (Karten außerhalb des Bildschirms, falsch
              ausgerichtete Pfeil-Icons, abgeschnittene Fotos).

  WICHTIG zur Sortierung UND Datumsaufteilung: Die eigentliche
  Sortierung (chronologisch nach Startdatum) passiert NICHT mehr hier im
  Template, sondern schon vorher beim Bauen der Seite, in
  src/_data/sortedEvents.js. Die Aufteilung in "zukünftig" und
  "vergangen" DARF dagegen nicht beim Bauen passieren (siehe
  eventsCarousel.js/partitionEventsByDate()) - deshalb bekommen ALLE
  DREI Karussells (Zukunft, Erinnerungen-Desktop, Erinnerungen-Mobile)
  hier zunächst dieselben, ungefilterten sortedEvents[lang], und erst
  eventsCarousel.js entscheidet beim Laden der Seite im Browser, welche
  Folie in welchem Karussell bleibt.

  Der Hintergrund bekommt denselben "Blob"-Effekt wie im Hero. #}
{% set t = de %}
{% if lang == "en" %}{% set t = en %}{% endif %}
{% if lang == "nl" %}{% set t = nl %}{% endif %}

<section class="reveal-section tone-cloud events-section visible">
  <div class="ambient-bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="ambient-layer ambient-layer-1"></div>
    <div class="ambient-layer ambient-layer-2"></div>
    <div class="ambient-layer ambient-layer-3"></div>
    <div class="ambient-layer ambient-layer-4"></div>
    <div class="ambient-layer ambient-layer-5"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="events-page-row">

    {# ========== SPALTE 1 (2/3): EYEBROW, TITEL, ZUKÜNFTIGE EVENTS ========== #}
    <div class="events-main">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="eyebrow-row">
          <span class="mono-label wine-label">{{ t.events.eyebrow | safe }}</span>
          <span class="eyebrow-line"></span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="section-title">
          {{ t.events.title }}<br />
          <span class="section-title-line2">{{ t.events.subtitle }}</span>
        </h1>

        <div
          class="events-carousel events-future"
          data-events-carousel
          data-events-scope="future"
          data-autoplay-ms="6500"
          data-goto-aria="{{ t.events.carousel.goto_aria }}"
          data-of-label="{{ t.events.carousel.of }}"
          aria-roledescription="carousel"
          aria-label="{{ t.events.eyebrow }}"
        >
          <div class="events-viewport" data-events-viewport>
            <ul class="events-track" data-events-track>
              {% for item in sortedEvents[lang] %}
              <li
                class="event-slide"
                role="group"
                aria-roledescription="slide"
                aria-label="{{ item.title }} ({{ loop.index }} {{ t.events.carousel.of }} {{ sortedEvents[lang].length }})"
                aria-hidden="true"
                data-events-slide
                data-title="{{ item.title }}"
                data-date-start="{{ item.date_iso }}"
                data-date-end="{{ item.date_end_iso | default(item.date_iso) }}"
              >
                <article class="event-card">
                  <div class="event-photo">
                    <img
                      src="{{ item.image.src | url }}"
                      alt="{{ item.image.alt }}"
                      loading="lazy"
                      decoding="async"
                    />
                  </div>
                  <div class="event-info">
                    <p class="mono-label event-meta">
                      <span class="event-date">{{ item.date }}</span>
                      <span class="event-meta-dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
                      <span class="event-time">{{ item.time }}</span>
                    </p>
                    <h2 class="event-title">{{ item.title }}</h2>
                    <p class="event-location">
                      <svg class="event-location-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M12 21s-7-6.1-7-11.4A7 7 0 0 1 19 9.6C19 14.9 12 21 12 21Z"></path>
                        <circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.4"></circle>
                      </svg>
                      {{ item.location }}
                    </p>
                    <p class="event-description">{{ item.description }}</p>
                    {% if item.link %}
                    <a class="event-link" href="{{ item.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                      {{ t.events.carousel.more_info }}
                      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="12" height="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line>
                        <polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline>
                      </svg>
                    </a>
                    {% endif %}
                  </div>
                </article>
              </li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </div>

          <p class="events-empty is-hidden" data-events-empty>{{ t.events.carousel.empty }}</p>

          <div class="events-controls" data-events-controls>
            <button type="button" class="events-arrow events-prev" data-events-prev aria-label="{{ t.events.carousel.prev_aria }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="15 6 9 12 15 18"></polyline></svg>
            </button>

            <button type="button" class="events-playpause" data-events-playpause data-play-label="{{ t.events.carousel.play_aria }}" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="{{ t.events.carousel.pause_aria }}">
              <svg class="icon-pause" data-icon-pause viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="5" width="4" height="14"></rect><rect x="14" y="5" width="4" height="14"></rect></svg>
              <svg class="icon-play" data-icon-play viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" hidden><polygon points="7 4 20 12 7 20"></polygon></svg>
            </button>

            <div class="events-dots" data-events-dots role="tablist" aria-label="{{ t.events.carousel.dots_aria }}"></div>

            <button type="button" class="events-arrow events-next" data-events-next aria-label="{{ t.events.carousel.next_aria }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 6 15 12 9 18"></polyline></svg>
            </button>
          </div>

          <p class="visually-hidden" data-events-live aria-live="polite"></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {# ========== SPALTE 2 (1/3): VERGANGENE EVENTS ("Schöne Erinnerungen") ========== #}
    <div class="past-events">
      <div class="past-events-inner">
        <div class="eyebrow-row past-eyebrow-row">
          <span class="mono-label light-gold-label">{{ t.events.past.eyebrow }}</span>
          <span class="eyebrow-line light-line"></span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="past-heading">
          {{ t.events.past.heading_line1 }}<br />
          <span class="past-heading-line2">{{ t.events.past.heading_line2 }}</span>
        </h2>

        {# ---------- Desktop (ab 900px): Flip-Kalender-Effekt ----------
           Unverändert wie bisher - wird per CSS unter 900px komplett
           ausgeblendet (siehe .past-flip-desktop in styles.css). #}
        <div
          class="past-carousel past-flip-desktop"
          data-past-carousel
          data-of-label="{{ t.events.past.of }}"
          aria-roledescription="carousel"
          aria-label="{{ t.events.past.eyebrow }}"
        >
          <div class="past-body">
            <div class="past-viewport" data-past-viewport>
              <ul class="past-track" data-past-track>
                {% for item in sortedEvents[lang] %}
                <li
                  class="past-slide"
                  role="group"
                  aria-roledescription="slide"
                  aria-label="{{ item.title }}"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                  data-past-slide
                  data-date-start="{{ item.date_iso }}"
                  data-date-end="{{ item.date_end_iso | default(item.date_iso) }}"
                >
                  <article class="past-card">
                    <p class="mono-label past-card-year">{{ (item.date_iso | default("")).slice(0, 4) }}</p>
                    <h3 class="past-card-title">{{ item.title }}</h3>
                    <p class="past-card-location">
                      <svg class="past-card-location-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M12 21s-7-6.1-7-11.4A7 7 0 0 1 19 9.6C19 14.9 12 21 12 21Z"></path>
                        <circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.4"></circle>
                      </svg>
                      {{ item.location }}
                    </p>
                    <p class="past-card-description">
                      <img
                        class="past-card-photo"
                        src="{{ item.image.src | url }}"
                        alt="{{ item.image.alt }}"
                        loading="lazy"
                      />{{ item.description }}
                    </p>
                  </article>
                </li>
                {% endfor %}
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="past-controls" data-past-controls>
              <button type="button" class="past-arrow past-prev" data-past-prev aria-label="{{ t.events.past.prev_aria }}">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="18 15 12 9 6 15"></polyline></svg>
              </button>
              <span class="past-counter" data-past-counter aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <button type="button" class="past-arrow past-next" data-past-next aria-label="{{ t.events.past.next_aria }}">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="events-empty past-empty is-hidden" data-past-empty>{{ t.events.past.empty }}</p>

          <p class="visually-hidden" data-past-live aria-live="polite"></p>
        </div>

        {# ---------- Mobile (unter 900px): struktureller Klon des Zukunfts-Karussells ----------
           Identische CSS-Klassen (.events-carousel/.events-viewport/
           .events-track/.event-slide/.event-card/.events-controls) UND
           identischer JS-Regler (createCarouselController) wie das
           Zukunfts-Karussell oben - dadurch exakt dasselbe, bereits
           bewährte Verhalten (Pfeile, Punkte, Fingerwischen). Einzige
           Inhalts-Unterschiede: nur Jahr statt Datum/Uhrzeit, keine
           Location, kein "mehr erfahren"-Link. Kein Play/Pause-Button
           (kein Autoplay gewünscht) - setupEventsCarousel() in
           eventsCarousel.js pausiert diesen Regler nach der
           Initialisierung explizit anhand von data-events-scope. Wird
           per CSS ab 900px ausgeblendet (siehe .past-mobile-carousel in
           styles.css), zeigt sich also nur dort, wo der Flip-Effekt
           oben per CSS versteckt ist. #}
        <div
          class="events-carousel past-mobile-carousel"
          data-events-carousel
          data-events-scope="past-mobile"
          data-goto-aria="{{ t.events.carousel.goto_aria }}"
          data-of-label="{{ t.events.carousel.of }}"
          aria-roledescription="carousel"
          aria-label="{{ t.events.past.eyebrow }}"
        >
          <div class="events-viewport" data-events-viewport>
            <ul class="events-track" data-events-track>
              {% for item in sortedEvents[lang] %}
              <li
                class="event-slide"
                role="group"
                aria-roledescription="slide"
                aria-label="{{ item.title }}"
                aria-hidden="true"
                data-events-slide
                data-title="{{ item.title }}"
                data-date-start="{{ item.date_iso }}"
                data-date-end="{{ item.date_end_iso | default(item.date_iso) }}"
              >
                <article class="event-card">
                  <div class="event-photo">
                    <img
                      src="{{ item.image.src | url }}"
                      alt="{{ item.image.alt }}"
                      loading="lazy"
                      decoding="async"
                    />
                  </div>
                  <div class="event-info">
                    <p class="mono-label event-meta">
                      <span class="event-date">{{ (item.date_iso | default("")).slice(0, 4) }}</span>
                    </p>
                    <h2 class="event-title">{{ item.title }}</h2>
                    <p class="event-description">{{ item.description }}</p>
                  </div>
                </article>
              </li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </div>

          <p class="events-empty is-hidden" data-events-empty>{{ t.events.past.empty }}</p>

          <div class="events-controls" data-events-controls>
            <button type="button" class="events-arrow events-prev" data-events-prev aria-label="{{ t.events.past.prev_aria }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="15 6 9 12 15 18"></polyline></svg>
            </button>

            <div class="events-dots" data-events-dots role="tablist" aria-label="{{ t.events.carousel.dots_aria }}"></div>

            <button type="button" class="events-arrow events-next" data-events-next aria-label="{{ t.events.past.next_aria }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 6 15 12 9 18"></polyline></svg>
            </button>
          </div>

          <p class="visually-hidden" data-events-live aria-live="polite"></p>
        </div>

        <div class="past-whatsapp">
          <p class="past-whatsapp-text">{{ t.events.past.whatsapp_text }}</p>
          <div data-phone-contact-theme="dark" data-copy-label="{{ t.nav.copy_phone_button }}" data-copied-label="{{ t.nav.copied_button }}"></div>
          <p class="past-whatsapp-hint">{{ t.events.past.whatsapp_hint }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>